<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμᾰϊκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermes,
			</span></i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marin.
					<u>Procl.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; <i>of the planet Mercury,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.113
				</span></i>
			 C.; so in Astrol., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. ἔργα</span>”
				<i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.203
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑ. πράξεις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8(4).238
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				77
			</span></i>; also of certain <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.Laod.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				5(1).187
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					808.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
			= sq. <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.150
			</span></i>.</div>
